                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I honestly didn't think I'd have as much fun playing this game as I have been. I avoid rogue-like's and have strategy and simulation as filtered out tags. Yet it's very addictive! There is something about learning from each play through and striving to get further next time that keeps it interesting and entertaining. \n\nThis is a fabulous game for people who love real time strategy and micro managing! I highly recommend!\n",
